Upstream-Name: dtk-iptv
Comment:
 This package is only a player. It contains no channels, streams or playlists.
 The default playlist catalogue is downloaded at run time from the iptv-org
 project (https://github.com/iptv-org/iptv) and is subject to that project's
 license and terms.

